               <li>Rename By FITS Header 1.3</li>
               <li>Expand Integration 1.3</li>
               <li>Batch Image Keyword Editor 4.0</li>
               <li>Batch XISF Cleaner 1.0</li>
            </ul>
            <p>All scripts are installed under Script &gt; Batch Processing.</p>
         </description>
